WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:10.660
- My name's Tommy Dunne

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:13.840
and I'm the weapons master
on HBO, Game of Thrones.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.610
Everyone tells me it's the
coolest job in the world

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.180
and I say it's the one
with the biggest headache.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:21.720
But no, it's cool, it's
mainly down to myself,

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.570
what the look and design is

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.377
and the feel of all the weaponry.

00:00:25.377 --> 00:00:28.890
And again, I never look and
never chase up the image

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.080
that George had in his books,

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:33.840
because I didn't want to be persuaded by

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.640
his feel or his interpretation,

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:41.247
I like my feel of it and my
interpretation of what it is.

00:00:41.247 --> 00:00:45.180
- How did you make Beric
Dondarrion's flaming sword?

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:47.590
- That's a combination between ourselves

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:50.170
and the special effects team,

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:53.760
because obviously I made and
designed the original one,

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.370
which was quite a basic sword,

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:57.560
nothing fancy about it, the Beric one,

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.350
but then obviously the
special effects team

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:02.510
had to come up with a
procedure of lighting it,

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:06.460
so they made an internal gas
system into a hollow sword

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:09.400
and then we just supplied
all the cross guards

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.910
on with the hand piece,

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:12.380
so they would make a gas rig

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.990
and they would make a, basically a sword

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:19.260
that was impregnated
with a lighting liquid,

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:21.360
that could be lit by flame,

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:24.600
so it would keep alight
for, about half a minute

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.020
and I think it was simple enough,

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:28.180
the physical one that they fought with,

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:30.510
but the gas one was a bit intricate.

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:33.250
To ignite it and to turn it off,

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:37.380
but the effects (team) did a
very, very good job, good lads.

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:40.120
The Oathkeeper was the tricky one.

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:42.093
Making sure it looked like what it was,

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:47.110
using jewels like Swarovski crystals.

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:48.620
Needle was a nice one

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:50.480
because it was one of those
things where obviously,

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:51.550
she's a very young girl.

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:54.743
At that stage I think
Maisie was only like 12, 13.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:57.570
And she was a very petite girl.

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.310
So we know that the
weapon would have to be

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:04.200
some sort of file or that
kind of scenario where

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.240
being a needle, it was
exactly what the name said.

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:08.460
It looks like a needle.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:10.600
It's quite a natural small little sword.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:11.570
And it hasn't changed,

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:12.470
the holder hasn't changed.

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:15.650
It's all as is, obviously she's grown up,

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:17.660
not a lot but she's grown up.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:19.210
So the sword has kept with her,

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:21.393
it's the same.

00:02:21.393 --> 00:02:22.226
We've never had to play with it.

00:02:22.226 --> 00:02:23.480
Actually she's always been good with it,

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:25.495
considering how she fights.

00:02:25.495 --> 00:02:28.197
She fights left-handed but
she's actually right-handed.

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:33.480
They're dangerous enough at the same time,

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:35.340
I mean, the hero ones for example,

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.060
will be a tougher weld
with the steel blades.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:39.900
We'd never fight with them
but we'd always have them

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:42.123
for the hero feel, the hero look.

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:46.840
We always then make an
aluminium version of the blade.

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:49.210
We'll make a bamboo version and
we'll make a rubber version.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:53.370
So we have all the
components that will be safe.

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:56.990
So anybody fights will
be bamboo on bamboo,

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:57.823
will be rubber on rubber,
will be aluminium on aluminium

00:02:59.856 --> 00:03:03.300
and we never mix and match
the different blades.

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:08.750
There are so many
different looks and styles

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:10.561
that are brought into the tales.

00:03:10.561 --> 00:03:13.070
Absolute probably, 10,000,
15,000 different types,

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:15.539
depending on what the weapon would be.

00:03:15.539 --> 00:03:16.372
If it's a principal weapon,

00:03:16.372 --> 00:03:18.020
you'd have a couple of hero ones.

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:20.973
You'd have four or five fighting swords.

00:03:21.877 --> 00:03:25.290
And again six or eight safety swords.

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:28.393
So we make sure everybody's
a bit safe on set.

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:30.840
Fight or if you have to ride horses

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:34.400
that's when we have rubber
scabbards, rubber swords

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.080
so everybody walks away.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.520
Some of our actors are very strong,

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:38.353
so what happens is that

00:03:38.353 --> 00:03:41.155
they just keep hammering
and hammering so hard.

00:03:41.155 --> 00:03:43.550
They suddenly realize
when they have bamboo,

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:45.590
that they can move faster.

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:48.540
And with some of our
training regimes for example,

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:51.670
we had Pod and Brienne fighting.

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:53.472
That's a scenario where we had
to make sure that there was

00:03:53.472 --> 00:03:55.197
a bit of bamboo to try and slow down

00:03:55.197 --> 00:03:57.105
and take the power away from Brienne.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:00.260
Especially that Gwendoline
is a strong girl and

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.520
puts a lot of power into it.

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:03.010
So we just had to try and find a way

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.640
of pulling that power back a little bit.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.850
The problem with an aluminium sword

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.491
or even a wooden sword

00:04:09.491 --> 00:04:13.150
is that's really gonna hit
hard onto another sword.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:15.160
But when you're fighting with a bamboo,

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.183
you'll find that less is more with them.

00:04:17.183 --> 00:04:19.280
So it actually does slow them
down a bit with the power.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:22.090
- I would imagine maybe in
the Battle of the Bastards,

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:24.746
there's a bamboo sword in there somewhere.

00:04:24.746 --> 00:04:26.813
- There's a battlefield
of swords in that one.

00:04:26.813 --> 00:04:28.440
A lot of rubber,

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:30.560
there's none in that one.

00:04:30.568 --> 00:04:32.776
It will be the best season ever.

00:04:32.784 --> 00:04:34.201
Nothing would surpass this.

00:04:34.201 --> 00:04:36.878
- I woke my deaf grandmother

00:04:36.878 --> 00:04:38.610
screaming at the television.

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:40.523
So if it's going to be better than that.

00:04:40.523 --> 00:04:42.480
I'm really excited.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.267
- I think you'll wake up
a few ancestors this year,

00:04:45.267 --> 00:04:47.883
next year when it next comes out,

00:04:47.883 --> 00:04:49.485
not only your granny.

